  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scatec Solar AS will do a feasibility study of two solar powr projects in Indonesia:
1) diesel displacement wi th solar PV at remote island location 
2) 300 MW solar floating project on an exisiting hydro power dam in central Java</narrative>
